/* MapVote map images - generated by tools (do not edit by hand).
   Stock keys: .mv-map-map_{name}; workshop keys: .mv-map-ws_{name}.
   This sheet contains ONLY map background images so custom image packs can
   replace it without touching the UI stylesheet (hud_v1.vcss). */

